n\nThese files exist and are the only ones the actions below may reach:\n\n- cmd/provenance/compile_cmd.go (package cobra; injection points: command, flags, subcommands)\n- cmd/provenance/compile_run.go (package go; injection points: decls, imports)\n- cmd/provenance/main.go (package cobra; injection points: commands, persistent_flags, root)\n- cmd/provenance/merge_manifest_cmd.go (package cobra; injection points: command, flags, subcommands)\n- cmd/provenance/merge_manifest_run.go (package go; injection points: decls, imports)\n\nThese are part of the change but are not written by this tool. No action can reach them, and nothing you return should try to:\n\n- cmd/provenance/compile_check_test.go (declared unmanaged by cobra)\n- cmd/provenance/compile_test.go (declared unmanaged by cobra)\n- cmd/provenance/merge_manifest_test.go (declared unmanaged by cobra)\n\n## Actions\n\n{\n  \"actions\": [\n    {\n      \"action\": \"addDefaultFlag\",\n      \"package\": \"cobra\",\n      \"description\": \"Add a string flag with a default value to one command.\",\n      \"kwargs\": {\n        \"bin\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"required\": true\n        },\n        \"command\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"required\": true,\n          \"description\": \"The command's path joined with hyphens.\"\n        },\n        \"default\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"required\": true,\n          \"description\": \"The default value.\"\n        },\n        \"flag\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"required\": true,\n          \"description\": \"The flag's long name without dashes, e.g. message-file.\"\n        },\n        \"usage\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"required\": true,\n          \"description\": \"One-line help text.\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"injects_into\": [\n        \"cmd/{{bin}}/{{command|snake}}_cmd.go\"\n      ],\n      \"anchor\": [\n        \"flags\"\n      ],\n      \"re